  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(faqSchema)} />
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(localBusinessSchema)} />
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-8 pt-16 pb-24">
    <header class="mb-8">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
        <span class="bg-primary/20 text-primary font-label font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-widest px-3 py-1 rounded-full">{post.category}</span>
        <time class="font-body text-sm text-secondary">{post.date}</time>
      </div>
      <h1 class="font-headline text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tighter text-on-surface mb-4">{post.title}</h1>
      <p class="font-body text-lg text-secondary leading-relaxed">{post.description}</p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <section class="mb-12">
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed mb-6">Malaysia's fashion industry runs on a delicate calculation: customers expect the unboxing to feel premium, but the carton itself has to survive a Pos Laju van and three handling hubs without crushing the contents. Quinocycle has supplied cartons to boutique modest-wear brands in Bangsar, batik makers shipping out of Bangi, and large textile distributors in Klang since 2010. Here is what we have learned about getting fashion packaging right — without overspending.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-6">Apparel Cartons That Stay Crush-Free</h2>
        <h3 class="font-headline text-xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">Single-Garment Mailer Boxes</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed mb-6">For Shopee and Lazada single-piece orders, a flat 280x200x80mm 3-ply mailer is the sweet spot. It stays inside dimensional weight tiers for J&T and Pos Laju, slides easily into letter-sized courier bags, and protects folded garments from creasing. Going thinner risks crush damage during stacking; going thicker pushes you into the next courier weight bracket.</p>

        <h3 class="font-headline text-xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">Multi-Piece Wholesale Outers</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed mb-6">When you ship 30-50 pieces to a retailer in Penang or Johor Bahru, weight stacks up fast. Cotton t-shirts run 200-300g each — a 50-piece carton easily hits 12-15kg. We recommend 5-ply double-wall outers in the 500x350x250mm range for these shipments. The extra fluting prevents the bottom of the stack from sagging when warehouse staff stack five high.</p>

        <h3 class="font-headline text-xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">Hanging Garment Cartons</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed mb-6">Bridal, formalwear, and high-end ready-to-wear ships best in tall hanging cartons that preserve the silhouette. We make these to order with reinforced top bars at 1200x500x500mm for kebaya, jubah, and gown shipments. The internal hanger crossbar is included.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-6">Batik & Traditional Textile Packaging</h2>
        <h3 class="font-headline text-xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">Folded Sarong & Baju Kurung Sets</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed mb-6">Traditional textiles travel best flat. Our 350x250x100mm boxes hold a typical baju kurung set with selendang, or three folded sarongs, with no shifting. Lint-free virgin kraft means no fibre transfer onto silk or songket weave.</p>

        <h3 class="font-headline text-xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">Rolled Batik Metres for Tailors</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed mb-6">Tailoring shops and mass producers ship batik in 5-10 metre rolls. Our long tube cartons (1000x150x150mm) protect the roll without crushing. We supply both individual mailer tubes and bundled multi-roll outers for B2B shipments.</p>

        <h3 class="font-headline text-xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">Songket & Ceremonial Pieces</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed mb-6">Songket and ceremonial fabrics need extra rigidity to prevent creasing. Pair our flat 5-ply boxes with acid-free tissue and cardboard inserts; we can supply both as part of one bundled wholesale order.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-6">Branding Options for Fashion Brands</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed mb-6">A plain kraft mailer is fine for utility. But fashion is sold on the unboxing moment — your customer sharing the box on Instagram or TikTok. We offer 1-4 colour flexo printing on outside walls, plus inside-print for the moment of opening. Common requests include logo and tagline on the lid, a thank-you message inside, and a small care-instructions panel printed on the inner wall. Minimum print run is 1,000 cartons; lead time is 7-10 working days from artwork sign-off.</p>
      </section>

      <div class="bg-surface-variant/50 border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-8 my-12">
        <h3 class="font-headline text-xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-6">Fashion Brand Carton Spec Cheat Sheet</h3>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div>
            <p class="font-label text-primary font-bold text-sm mb-2">SINGLE GARMENT MAILER</p>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm">3-ply | 280x200x80mm</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-label text-primary font-bold text-sm mb-2">WHOLESALE BULK OUTER</p>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm">5-ply | 500x350x250mm</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-label text-primary font-bold text-sm mb-2">BATIK ROLL TUBE</p>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm">3-ply | 1000x150x150mm</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-label text-primary font-bold text-sm mb-2">HANGING GOWN BOX</p>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm">5-ply | 1200x500x500mm</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-6">Fashion Packaging FAQs</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">What size carton works best for folded apparel orders?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">280x200x80mm 3-ply mailers for single-piece online orders. 500x350x250mm 5-ply for multi-piece wholesale shipments to retailers.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">Will the carton damage delicate fabrics like silk?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">No — our virgin kraft is lint-free and smooth. For songket or premium silk, add an acid-free tissue layer between fabric and box wall.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">Do you supply cartons for batik shipments?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">Yes — flat-pack boxes for folded sarongs and baju kurung sets, plus long tubes for rolled batik metres going to tailoring shops.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">Can you print our brand logo on the box?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">Yes — 1-4 colour flexo print available from 1,000 cartons. Lead time 7-10 working days from artwork approval.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">What's the minimum order for fashion brand cartons?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">RM 1,000 minimum, which usually equates to 300-500 mailer boxes plus tape and bubble wrap.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12 bg-primary/5 border border-primary/20 rounded-lg p-8">
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">Wholesale Fashion Packaging from Balakong</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed mb-6">Whether you ship 50 modest-wear pieces a week or distribute textiles across Peninsular Malaysia, Quinocycle has the right carton at wholesale rates. Same-week dispatch from our Balakong factory.</p>
