          <li>📞 <strong>Phone:</strong> +60 16 8916 381 / 03-8962 6381</li>
          <li>📧 <strong>Email:</strong> quinocycle@gmail.com</li>
          <li>📍 <strong>Address:</strong> No.13, Jalan Taming P/1, Taming Jaya, Balakong, Selangor 43300</li>
        </ul>
        <a href={WA_LINK} class="inline-block bg-primary text-on-primary font-label font-bold text-sm px-6 py-3 rounded-lg hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity">💬 Chat on WhatsApp</a>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">Conclusion: The Box Is Part of the Brand</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed mb-4">Fashion is one of the few categories where the packaging is part of the product experience. Spec the wrong box and the customer's first impression is a creased dress and a crushed corner. Spec the right one — sized to garment, branded with intent — and you turn every shipment into a marketing moment.</p>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed">Talk to Quinocycle about your fashion packaging programme. We supply Klang Valley brands and textile distributors year-round.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
